<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Edit Menu</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.906%" size="4" class="whs3">
<p>Most of the basic operations are located in Edit menu. The Edit Menu is divided in 4 sections as follow:</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="709" class="whs4">
<col class="whs5">
<col class="whs6">
