<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Final"></a>Final Operations' group</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="792" class="whs16">
<col class="whs17">
<col class="whs18">
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs19">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="123px" class="whs20">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="547px" class="whs21">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" class="whs22">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs23">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="123px" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func">Enable Undo</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="547px" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Switches On/Off the Undo command.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/enable_undo.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs28">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="123px" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Undo</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="547px" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Restores the previous state of data (one step back) in the scene. Undo command is grayed if the option Enable Undo is unchecked.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Undo.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs23">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="123px" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func">Hold</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="547px" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Saves the current state of the scene in a separate file. The user can restore it when necessary using the command Fetch.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/hold.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs23">
<td width="123px" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func">Fetch</p>
</td>
<td width="547px" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Restores a previous state of the scene (multiple steps back). The command is grayed if there is no state saved, i.e. when the command Hold is not yet used.</p>
</td>
<td class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/fetch.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Basic_Operations__group"></a>Basic Operations' group</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="793" class="whs29">
<col class="whs30">
<col class="whs31">
<col class="whs32">
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="19.11%" class="whs34">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="72.189%" class="whs35">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="6.97%" class="whs36">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td width="19.11%" class="whs37">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Cut</span></p>
</td>
<td width="72.189%" class="whs38">
<p class="normal-table">Deletes the visible selection and places it in the clipboard. Data in the clipboard is available for KUBE only. &#160;This command is grayed if there is no selection or all selections are hidden.</p>
</td>
<td width="6.97%" class="whs39">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/cut.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td width="19.11%" class="whs37">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Copy</span></p>
</td>
<td width="72.189%" class="whs38">
<p class="normal-table">Copies the visible selection and places it in the clipboard. Data in the clipboard is available for KUBE only. This command is grayed if there is no selection or all selections are hidden.</p>
</td>
<td width="6.97%" class="whs39">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/copy.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td width="19.11%" class="whs37">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Paste As New Entity</span></p>
</td>
<td width="72.189%" class="whs38">
<p class="normal-table">Moves the data from the clipboard into the active document. This command is grayed if the clipboard is empty. Note that you cannot paste twice – once you call this command it will be grayed.</p>
</td>
<td width="6.97%" class="whs39">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Paste_as_New_Entity.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td width="19.11%" class="whs37">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Delete</span></p>
</td>
<td width="72.189%" class="whs38">
<p class="normal-table">Deletes the visible selection. There is no undo for this command except for partial scan data selections.</p>
</td>
<td width="6.97%" class="whs39">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/delete.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="bullet">&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Entities__group"></a>Entities' group</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="794" class="whs40">
<col class="whs41">
<col class="whs42">
<col class="whs32">
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="18.478%" class="whs43">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="72.147%" class="whs44">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="6.97%" class="whs36">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td width="18.478%" class="whs45">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Create New Entity From Selection</span></p>
</td>
<td width="72.147%" class="whs46">
<p class="normal-table">Removes the visible selection and generates a copy of it as separate entity. This command is grayed if there is no selection or it is not visible. It is applicable to compound entities – scan data, meshes, point clouds, and polylines.</p>
</td>
<td width="6.97%" class="whs39">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/create_new_entity_from_selection.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td width="18.478%" class="whs45">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Combine Selected Entities</span></p>
</td>
<td width="72.147%" class="whs46">
<p class="normal-table">Combines all visible selected entities of one type into single entity of the same type. This command is grayed if there is no selection or it is not visible. It is applicable to compound entities – scan data, meshes, point clouds, and polylines.</p>
</td>
<td width="6.97%" class="whs39">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/combine_selected_entities.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Offset_Points_group"></a>Resize group</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="795" class="whs47">
<col class="whs48">
<col class="whs49">
<col class="whs32">
<tr valign="top" class="whs50">
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="18.491%" class="whs51">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="72.83%" class="whs52">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="6.97%" class="whs36">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs53">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="18.491%" class="whs54">
<p class="normal-table-func">Offset Points</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="72.83%" class="whs55">
<p class="normal-table">Offsets visible selected entities along the <a class="glossterm" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1">normal</a> <span class="glosstext" style="display:'none';" id="POPUP169345099">A normal is a vector that is perpendicular to a surface.</span> toward the sensor. This command works on scan data and meshes only. It is grayed if there is no visible selection of scan data or meshes.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="6.97%" class="whs39">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Offset_Points.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs56">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="18.491%" class="whs54">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Scale Points</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="72.83%" class="whs55">
